    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17779541015625,
        513.4029541015625,
        144.529296875
      ],
      "text": "in severely ill children when rapid diagnosis is crucial. It is important to note that a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
